%% OIDC authorization-code + PKCE, then JWKS-validated API access.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (SPA)
    participant I as OIDC Provider
    participant C as Control Plane
    participant D as PostgreSQL (RLS)

    B->>I: /authorize (response_type=code, code_challenge=S256)
    I-->>B: 302 redirect with authorization code
    B->>I: /token (code + code_verifier)
    I-->>B: access_token (JWT, aud=sap-control-plane) + id_token

    Note over B,C: Every API call carries the Bearer access token
    B->>C: GET /api/v1/runs  (Authorization: Bearer …)
    C->>I: fetch JWKS (cached)
    C->>C: verify signature · iss · aud · exp, then extract tenant_id
    C->>D: WithTenant(tenant_id): set app.current_tenant, then query
    D-->>C: only this tenant's rows (RLS)
    C-->>B: tenant-scoped JSON
